# Everything below is OPTIONAL. There is no login and no required database —
# copy this file to .env only if you want one or more of the features below;
# otherwise just run `npm install && npm run dev` with no .env at all.

# Optional — enables saved analysis history (/dashboard/history) and the
# company-management screen (/admin/companies): editing benchmarks, student
# interview reports, and turning those (or AI research / job postings) into
# reviewable suggestions. Without it, the analyzer itself still works fully,
# using the built-in default company benchmarks.
# Any Postgres instance works (Neon, Supabase, a local Postgres, etc).
# Neon example: postgresql://user:password@ep-xxxx.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/skillgap?sslmode=require
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/skillgap"

# Optional — only needed to turn on "Research with AI" in the admin
# Companies screen (see README's "Keeping company benchmarks current").
# Without it, that button just reports it isn't configured; nothing else
# in the app requires it. Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY="sk-ant-..."

# Optional — only needed to turn on "Check job postings" (the external-jobs
# benchmark source). Without it, that button just reports it isn't
# configured. Get one by subscribing (free tier available) to JSearch on
# RapidAPI: https://rapidapi.com/letscrape-6bRBa3QguO5/api/jsearch
# RAPIDAPI_KEY="..."
